    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Check</strong> four link depth on an enemy. Enemies consider your aura to be difficult terrain. This lasts for one minute, or until your link breaks.</p><p><strong>Energize:</strong> You may spend two additional link depth when initiating this aura to cause the difficult terrain to only allow enemies to 1 foot for every 3 feet they would move until Fatigue ends.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
